<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A6" title="In WebTrap: Stealthy Mid-Task Hijacking of Browser Agents During Navigation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F </span>Limitations</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
