<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-0.8pt;"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2605.08310v1/spider_web_twemoji.svg" id="g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:15/15;" width="15" height="15"></object></span>WebTrap: Stealthy Mid-Task Hijacking of Browser Agents During Navigation</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Zhichao Liu
