<div id="Ax1.p10" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.p10.1" class="ltx_p">C.2  Defense baseline implementations<span id="Ax1.p10.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_leader ltx_inline-block" style="width:5.5pt;">.</span><a href="#A3.SS2" title="C.2 Defense baseline implementations ‣ Appendix C Baselines and defenses ‣ WebTrap: Stealthy Mid-Task Hijacking of Browser Agents During Navigation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_ref ltx_nolink" style="--ltx-fg-color:#00008C;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.2</span></span></a></p>
</div>
<div id="Ax1.p11" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.p11.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax1.p11.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_align_left ltx_inline-block" style="width:341.0pt;--ltx-bg-color:#F6F6F6;"><span id="Ax1.p11.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#009EAA;">D</span> <span id="Ax1.p11.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Evaluation protocols</span> <a href="#A4" title="Appendix D Evaluation protocols ‣ WebTrap: Stealthy Mid-Task Hijacking of Browser Agents During Navigation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_ref ltx_nolink" style="--ltx-fg-color:#00008C;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D</span></span></a></span></p>
</div>
<div id="Ax1.p12" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.p12.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax1.p12.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_align_left ltx_inline-block" style="width:341.0pt;--ltx-bg-color:#F6F6F6;"><span id="Ax1.p12.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#009EAA;">E</span> <span id="Ax1.p12.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Additional experimental results</span> <a href="#A5" title="Appendix E Additional experimental results ‣ WebTrap: Stealthy Mid-Task Hijacking of Browser Agents During Navigation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_ref ltx_nolink" style="--ltx-fg-color:#00008C;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E</span></span></a></span></p>
</div>
<div id="Ax1.p13" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.p13.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax1.p13.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_align_left ltx_inline-block" style="width:341.0pt;--ltx-bg-color:#F6F6F6;"><span id="Ax1.p13.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#009EAA;">F</span> <span id="Ax1.p13.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Limitations</span> <a href="#A6" title="Appendix F Limitations ‣ WebTrap: Stealthy Mid-Task Hijacking of Browser Agents During Navigation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_ref ltx_nolink" style="--ltx-fg-color:#00008C;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">F</span></span></a></span></p>
