<div id="A1.SS2.p8" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p8.1" class="ltx_p">For the Inertia stage, the expected output must include a prerequisite rationale, a concrete action chain, and a rewritten attacker objective.
The attacker objective must be framed as a necessary prerequisite before continuing the original user task, rather than an unrelated side task.
The output must preserve the semantics of the referenced attacker objective and must not require the agent to abandon, replace, or ignore the original user task.
The specific prompt template is shown in Prompt <span class="ltx_ref ltx_missing_label ltx_ref_self"></span>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p9" class="ltx_para">
